#==============================================================================================
#
#   table_grid_predicates - Layout::TableGrid: the table-part predicates of TableGrid.h
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/TableGrid.h (lines 58-72): is_table_row_group, is_table_row and
#       is_table_column_group. Taken ahead of region r48 by region r43: the table fixup of every
#       TreeBuilder::build asks them of every node; their stubs are gone from
#       stub_r48_layout_table. Region r48 ports the rest of TableGrid around them.
